.TH SANCHALA-LOCKSCREEN-SETTINGS 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-lockscreen-settings \- Lock screen configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-lockscreen-settings
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure lock screen appearance, timeout, and security settings.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show current settings
.TP
.B timeout \fIseconds\fR
Set auto-lock timeout
.TP
.B wallpaper \fIimage\fR
Set lock screen wallpaper
.TP
.B clock \fIformat\fR
Set clock format (12h/24h)
.TP
.B notifications \fIon|off\fR
Show/hide notifications on lock screen
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-lockscreen-settings timeout 300
.TP
sanchala-lockscreen-settings wallpaper ~/Pictures/lock.jpg
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
